      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>'People care' is a nice sentiment, but it doesn't change the reality of the work. The work is the point. Once the masterpiece is complete, the artist is just a vessel that's been emptied. It feels almost undignified to wait around for the talent to fade and the mind to slip. There's a certain... elegance in knowing when the story has actually concluded, rather than letting it drag on into a mediocre epilogue. Don't you think?",
